      "explanation": "The original comment never explicitly or implicitly specifies that authors must conduct this analysis, nor does it clarify what changes to the paper are needed, so the inference that authors know exactly what to do is not supported by the evaluated text."
    },
    {
      "sentence": "This aligns with the criteria for a score of 4, as the action is implied but the implementation is clear.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "The comment fits the criteria for score 2 (implicit action that is vague) not 4 (implicit action with concrete implementation), so this application of the rubric threshold is incorrect."
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "The rationale consistently supports the incorrect score of 4 instead of the gold score of 2 via erroneous reasoning about the concreteness of the action, so it is classified as supporting the wrong score."
